<title>NEW ZEALAND: Northland Port ups yr net to NZ$8.54 mln.</title>
<headline>Northland Port ups yr net to NZ$8.54 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to Sept 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    8.54 vs 7.00</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			  20.59 vs 16.89</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    5.5 vs 4.75</p>
<p>    Total div for yr (cents)	  8.25 vs 7.25</p>
<p>    Turnover			     71.44 vs 73.16</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			12.59 vs 10.67</p>
<p>    Tax				     4.15 vs 3.62</p>
<p>    Equity earnings		     0.10 vs 0.07</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   41.47 vs same</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date Dec 19</p>
<p>Reg date Dec 6</p>
<p>    Ex div   Dec 9</p>
<p>Note - Northland Port Corporation (NZ) Ltd is a port operator.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
